  - WCNHFO   # Tornado/Severe T-storm Watch
  - SVRHFO   # Severe Thunderstorm Warning
  - TORHFO   # Tornado Warning
  - SVSHFO   # Severe Weather Statement
  - SMWHFO   # Special Marine Warning
  - MWSHFO   # Marine Weather Statement
